    <description>REV-71 Layer 2 safety net (single actor per Opportunity — replaces the spec §5 OLI_ALM_Code_AfterSave line-level design; see REV-71 architecture decision). Catches paths that bypass quotes: manual opp products, data loads, legacy non-CPQ opportunities, and line deletes (Amount roll-up change re-fires this flow). Same CMDT-driven §4 logic as Quote_ALM_Code_Stamp; idempotent — only writes when the derived code differs, so Layer-1 sync writes are no-ops here (spec §5 recursion guard). Child detection: SBQQ__ParentID__c (CPQ-synced bundle components). Clear mode only removes values matching configured TCV codes — monetary values never touched. ASSUMPTION: see REV-71 spec §8-Q4. Kill switch: ALM_Code_Setting__mdt.Control.Layer_2_Active__c.</description>
    <environments>Default</environments>
